                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without bones, especially as pertaining to meat or poultry prepared for eating."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1505137d-cefc-42d3-a22e-c4cf910fc14d",
                                                "sense_id": "a79f7e35-bc20-35c3-a9bb-556920c7598a",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: boned, deboned"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b399c6c-ba37-430d-a935-53e12e93320d",
                                                "sense_id": "a79f7e35-bc20-35c3-a9bb-556920c7598a",
                                                "text": "boneless chicken"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44fc077c-5372-411e-8fcb-51cd2543cf56",
                                                "sense_id": "a79f7e35-bc20-35c3-a9bb-556920c7598a",
                                                "text": "boneless, skinless chicken"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "abab5776-4365-4424-8dae-b7c676b80ac0",
                                                "sense_id": "a79f7e35-bc20-35c3-a9bb-556920c7598a",
                                                "text": "boneless wings"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2eb05b84-b880-40b1-8ee4-e0bd88d882e9",
                                                "sense_id": "a79f7e35-bc20-35c3-a9bb-556920c7598a",
                                                "text": "The packers were always originating such schemes—they had what they called \"boneless hams,\" which were all the odds and ends of pork stuffed into casings."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6327caa7-5990-34a6-95c1-79711103e8fb",
                                        "entry_id": "ca95386e-b846-3133-bf0f-abdabd589427",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without pizza crust; without pizza bones"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "humorous"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "467e9829-1c8c-3a5e-8962-74c47f09a76f",
                                        "entry_id": "ca95386e-b846-3133-bf0f-abdabd589427",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lacking strength, courage, or resolve."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "British",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb5b8969-26a8-4dbb-a6b9-b085e21b1147",
                                                "sense_id": "467e9829-1c8c-3a5e-8962-74c47f09a76f",
                                                "text": "I'm scared, I'm just boneless with fright."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d931283a-b7bd-4440-a503-c4ae01afe70f",
                                                "sense_id": "467e9829-1c8c-3a5e-8962-74c47f09a76f",
                                                "text": "I remember, when I was a child, being taken to the celebrated Barnum's circus, which contained an exhibition of freaks and monstrosities, but the exhibit … which I most desired to see was the one described as \"The Boneless Wonder.\" My parents judged that the spectacle would be too revolting and demoralizing for my youthful eyes, and I have waited fifty years to see the boneless wonder sitting on the Treasury Bench."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "275011fb-917e-4a89-8492-b9ad6ba643fe",
                                                "sense_id": "467e9829-1c8c-3a5e-8962-74c47f09a76f",
                                                "text": "Had the Green consortium made a straight bid, boneless fund managers would easily have outvoted private investors."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c7ba3a0-f6b9-4995-ad76-f9d94b0eca5d",
                                                "sense_id": "467e9829-1c8c-3a5e-8962-74c47f09a76f",
                                                "text": "In his final years he [John Ogdon] gave an interview to an American journalist who noticed that \"his handshake is a boneless fadeaway[\"]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
